  "description": "Enterprise-ready, heavily governed Zendesk integration for Support-Ops, CRM enrichment, and automated ticket triage. Exposes 22 commands spanning every major Zendesk resource. Features 5 exclusive orchestration commands (auto-assign orgs, deduplicate tickets, macro execution, daily metrics digests, bulk imports). Built with secure local-vault storage, robust rate-limiting (429 exponential backoff), input validation, and transaction-level idempotency via airlock payload hashes. [contest:2026Q3]",
